{"exam":{"id":"cfda04c57c30cd6942c55080","label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","year":2025,"round_no":1,"part":null,"variant":false},"subject":{"slug":"info-processing-practical","name":"정보처리기사 실기","notice":null},"grading":{"grade_bands":[{"min":60,"label":"합격"}],"section_fail_percent":40,"fail_scope":null,"hide_verdict":false},"questions":[{"id":"4c6626ae0a4aeb3043173c11","unit_id":"e069708c4df8d1a91124a230","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-1","number":1,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">TCP 세션이 정상적으로 수립된 이후, 공격자가 시퀀스 번호 등을 조작하여 합법적인 사용자의 세션을 탈취하고 인증 없이 해당 세션으로 통신을 이어가는 해킹 기법의 명칭을 쓰시오.</div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"세션 하이재킹 (Session Hijacking)","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":2,"unit_name":"정보보안","group_key":"security","group_name":"정보보안"},{"id":"f2c5861f8d2a060d7e305cb6","unit_id":"209cdae313c3cd954cadee57","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-2","number":2,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">데이터베이스 무결성 제약조건의 종류를 아래 표의 빈칸 ㄱ~ㄷ에 보기에서 골라 쓰시오.<br/><br/><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><table class=\"q-tbl\"><tr><th>종류</th><th>설명</th></tr><tr><td class=\"info-row\">ㄱ. ( ) 무결성</td><td>속성값은 해당 도메인에서 정의된 유효 범위 내에 있어야 한다</td></tr><tr><td class=\"info-row\">ㄴ. ( ) 무결성</td><td>기본 키는 NULL이 될 수 없으며 중복 값을 가질 수 없다</td></tr><tr><td class=\"info-row\">ㄷ. ( ) 무결성</td><td>외래 키 값은 참조 릴레이션의 기본 키 값이거나 NULL이어야 한다</td></tr></table></div><div>개체   참조   도메인</div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"ㄱ. 도메인 무결성 ㄴ. 개체 무결성 ㄷ. 참조 무결성","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":3,"unit_name":"데이터베이스","group_key":"db","group_name":"데이터베이스"},{"id":"ee810c499e81b1c91a4c551c","unit_id":"32d9bbcc38a59a29277f1a3e","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-3","number":3,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">3글자 영문 약자로 구성된 오류 검출 기법으로, 미리 약속한 생성 다항식(예: x³+x+1)으로 데이터를 이진 나눗셈하여 나머지를 검사값으로 사용한다. 수신 측은 동일한 다항식으로 재계산하여 오류를 검출한다. 이 기법의 약자를 쓰시오.</div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"CRC (Cyclic Redundancy Check)","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":4,"unit_name":"네트워크","group_key":"network","group_name":"네트워크"},{"id":"cf2d871a8641ef58865e97fa","unit_id":"e069708c4df8d1a91124a230","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-4","number":4,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">가짜 바이러스 경고나 허위 시스템 오류 메시지로 공포심을 유발하여 사용자가 불필요한 소프트웨어를 구매하거나 설치하도록 유도하는 악성 소프트웨어가 있다. '겁주다'라는 의미의 영어 단어에서 유래한 이 소프트웨어를 보기에서 골라 쓰시오.</div><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><div>ㄱ.컴포넌트웨어 &nbsp; ㄴ.유즈웨어 &nbsp; ㄷ.셔블웨어 &nbsp; ㄹ.스캐어웨어 &nbsp; ㅁ.안티스파이웨어 &nbsp; ㅂ.네트웨어 &nbsp; ㅅ.그룹웨어 &nbsp; ㅇ.애드웨어</div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"ㄹ. 스캐어웨어 (Scareware)","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":2,"unit_name":"정보보안","group_key":"security","group_name":"정보보안"},{"id":"3d84088925f85771c24d577f","unit_id":"32d9bbcc38a59a29277f1a3e","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-5","number":5,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">IP 주소와 MAC 주소 간 변환을 담당하는 두 프로토콜에 대한 설명이다. 각각의 명칭을 쓰시오.<br><br>(1) 알고 있는 IP 주소를 바탕으로 해당 장치의 MAC 주소를 알아내는 프로토콜<br>(2) 자신의 MAC 주소를 이용해 IP 주소를 역으로 조회하는 프로토콜</div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"(1) ARP (2) RARP","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":4,"unit_name":"네트워크","group_key":"network","group_name":"네트워크"},{"id":"7421d04c4dcada70403c051a","unit_id":"6128dbb84939004eef505aab","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-6","number":6,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 두 테이블을 참고하여 주어진 SQL의 실행 결과를 작성하시오.<br/><br/><div class=\"tables-row\"><div><div class=\"q-tbl-title\">emp 테이블</div><table class=\"q-tbl is-data\"><tr><th>id</th><th>name</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>홍길동</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>이순신</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>강감찬</td></tr></table></div><div><div class=\"q-tbl-title\">sal 테이블</div><table class=\"q-tbl is-data\"><tr><th>id</th><th>incentive</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>1000</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>300</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"q-sql\"><code class=\"language-sql\">SELECT name, incentive FROM emp, sal\nWHERE emp.id = sal.id AND incentive &gt;= 500</code></div></div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"name: 이순신 / incentive: 1000","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":6,"unit_name":"SQL문","group_key":"sql","group_name":"SQL문"},{"id":"a7b0cf50a9ee6a5b7cf120fb","unit_id":"209cdae313c3cd954cadee57","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-7","number":7,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">관계형 데이터베이스의 기본 용어에 대한 설명이다. 각 설명에 해당하는 용어를 보기에서 골라 쓰시오.<br><br>(1) 릴레이션에서 속성(열)의 개수<br>(2) 릴레이션에서 튜플(행)의 개수<br>(3) 한 릴레이션의 속성이 다른 릴레이션의 기본 키를 참조할 때 그 참조하는 속성<br>(4) 특정 속성에 입력 가능한 값의 유형이나 범위를 정의하여 무결성을 보장하는 기준</div><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><div>ㄱ.domain &nbsp; ㄴ.primary &nbsp; ㄷ.degree &nbsp; ㄹ.candidate &nbsp; ㅁ.cardinality &nbsp; ㅂ.attribute &nbsp; ㅅ.foreign</div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"(1) ㄷ. degree (2) ㅁ. cardinality (3) ㅅ. foreign (4) ㄱ. domain","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":3,"unit_name":"데이터베이스","group_key":"db","group_name":"데이터베이스"},{"id":"3ae61eab48b99e9ac40d86a2","unit_id":"32d9bbcc38a59a29277f1a3e","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-8","number":8,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">IP 주소 192.168.35.10, 서브넷 마스크 255.255.252.0인 PC가 브로드캐스트로 통신할 때, 동일 네트워크 대역에 속하여 수신 가능한 IP를 보기에서 모두 골라 쓰시오.</div><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><div><br>ㄱ. 192.168.34.1 &nbsp; ㄴ. 192.168.32.19 &nbsp; ㄷ. 192.168.35.200<br>ㄹ. 192.168.33.138 &nbsp; ㅁ. 192.168.35.50</div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ, ㅁ (모두 해당)","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":4,"unit_name":"네트워크","group_key":"network","group_name":"네트워크"},{"id":"ffa201a435e9c8f011c04643","unit_id":"1998c569e73079ffa108d349","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-9","number":9,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">소프트웨어 모듈 간 결합도(Coupling) 유형에 대한 설명이다. 각 설명에 해당하는 결합도를 보기에서 골라 쓰시오.<br><br>(1) 한 모듈이 다른 모듈의 내부 변수나 기능에 직접 접근하는 경우<br>(2) 모듈 간 인터페이스로 배열이나 자료구조가 전달되는 경우<br>(3) 모듈 밖에 선언된 전역 변수를 두 모듈이 공유·갱신하는 경우</div><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><div>ㄱ.자료 &nbsp; ㄴ.스탬프 &nbsp; ㄷ.제어 &nbsp; ㄹ.공통 &nbsp; ㅁ.내용 &nbsp; ㅂ.외부</div></div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"(1) ㅁ. 내용 결합도 (2) ㄴ. 스탬프 결합도 (3) ㄹ. 공통 결합도","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":1,"unit_name":"SW 개발/계획","group_key":"sw","group_name":"SW 개발/계획"},{"id":"629fc95f307797657d029591","unit_id":"1998c569e73079ffa108d349","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-10","number":10,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">서로 다른 인터페이스를 가진 클래스들을 함께 사용할 수 있도록, 기존 클래스(Adaptee)를 원하는 인터페이스(Target)에 맞게 변환하는 래퍼(Wrapper) 역할을 하는 구조 디자인 패턴의 명칭을 쓰시오.</div>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"Adapter (어댑터) 패턴","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":1,"unit_name":"SW 개발/계획","group_key":"sw","group_name":"SW 개발/계획"},{"id":"4a6c7f627ff78721fff1bbbc","unit_id":"1998c569e73079ffa108d349","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-t-11","number":11,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">문장(Statement) 커버리지 테스트를 수행하려 한다. 아래 코드를 참고하여 제어 흐름도 내 ①~⑥ 노드 별 해당되는 코드를 쓰고, 아래 문장 커버리지 순서를 완성하시오.<br><br><div class=\"q-spec\"><span class=\"q-spec__label\">보기</span><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">1  int Main(int b[], int m, int x) {\n2      int a = 0;\n3      while (a &lt; m || b[a] &lt; x) {\n4          if (b[a] &lt; 0)\n5              b[a] = -b[a];\n6          a++;\n7      }\n8      return 1;\n9  }</code></pre></div><br><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:12px 0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 560\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:300px\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" fill=\"#4a7eba\"/></marker></defs>\n\n<!-- ① int a=0 (사각형) -->\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">①</text>\n\n<!-- ①→② -->\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n\n<!-- ② while 조건 (마름모) -->\n<polygon points=\"160,92 220,122 160,152 100,122\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">②</text>\n\n<!-- ② YES → ③ (아래) -->\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"172\" fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"10\">YES</text>\n\n<!-- ② NO → ⑥ (오른쪽) -->\n<line x1=\"220\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n<text x=\"255\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"10\">NO</text>\n\n<!-- ⑥ return 1 (사각형, 오른쪽) -->\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"104\" width=\"34\" height=\"36\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"317\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">⑥</text>\n\n<!-- ③ if 조건 (마름모) -->\n<polygon points=\"160,188 220,218 160,248 100,218\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">③</text>\n\n<!-- ③ YES → ④ (아래) -->\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"268\" fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"10\">YES</text>\n\n<!-- ③ NO → ⑤ (왼쪽으로 빠져서 ⑤로 직접) -->\n<path d=\"M100,218 L60,218 L60,368 L118,368\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n<text x=\"45\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"10\">NO</text>\n\n<!-- ④ b[a]=-b[a] (사각형) -->\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"282\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"306\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">④</text>\n\n<!-- ④→⑤ -->\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"318\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n\n<!-- ⑤ a++ (사각형) -->\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"352\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"376\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">⑤</text>\n\n<!-- ⑤ → ② 루프백 (오른쪽으로 빠져서 위로) -->\n<path d=\"M200,370 L260,370 L260,122 L222,122\" stroke=\"#4a7eba\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#ar)\"/>\n\n</svg></div><br>문장 커버리지 순서: 1 → 2 → ( ⑦ )","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"① int a = 0; ② while (a &lt; m || b[a] &lt; x) ③ if (b[a] &lt; 0) ④ b[a] = -b[a]; ⑤ a++; ⑥ return 1; ⑦ 3 → 4 → 5 → 2 → 6","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":[],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":1,"unit_name":"SW 개발/계획","group_key":"sw","group_name":"SW 개발/계획"},{"id":"cb2b16f7b22c3cecd9833a79","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-c-1","number":12,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\ntypedef struct student {\n    char* name; int score[3];\n} Student;\nint dec(int enc){ return enc &amp; 0xA5; }\nint sum(Student* p){\n    return dec(p-&gt;score[0])+dec(p-&gt;score[1])+dec(p-&gt;score[2]);\n}\nint main(){\n    Student s[2] = {\n        {\"Kim\", {0xA0, 0xA5, 0xDB}},\n        {\"Lee\", {0xA0, 0xED, 0x81}}\n    };\n    int result = 0;\n    for(int i=0; i&lt;2; i++) result += sum(&amp;s[i]);\n    printf(\"%d\", result);\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"908","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","bit","비트 AND 0xA5 · 구조체"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"7abecfdf5e981aedafa4e6b0","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-java-1","number":13,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">public static void main(String[] args) {\n    System.out.println(calc(\"5\"));\n}\nstatic int calc(int value) {\n    if (value &lt;= 1) return value;\n    return calc(value - 1) + calc(value - 2);\n}\nstatic int calc(String str) {\n    int value = Integer.valueOf(str);\n    if (value &lt;= 1) return value;\n    return calc(value - 1) + calc(value - 3);\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"4","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","recur","오버로딩 · calc(String) vs calc(int)"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"5c5fdda88e953a0200a40045","unit_id":"3e763e8d8505a1722e19322a","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-py-1","number":14,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-python\">class Node:\n    def __init__(self, value):\n        self.value = value\n        self.children = []\n\ndef tree(li):\n    nodes = [Node(i) for i in li]\n    for i in range(1, len(li)):\n        nodes[(i - 1) // 2].children.append(nodes[i])\n    return nodes[0]\n\ndef calc(node, level=0):\n    if node is None:\n        return 0\n    return (node.value if level % 2 == 1 else 0) \\\n         + sum(calc(n, level + 1) for n in node.children)\n\nli = [3, 5, 8, 12, 15, 18, 21]\nroot = tree(li)\nprint(calc(root))</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"13","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["python","class","클래스 · 트리 재귀 · 레벨 판별"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":8,"unit_name":"Python","group_key":"lang-python","group_name":"Python"},{"id":"d25aa10cb6402dd4bdfd3748","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-c-2","number":15,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\ntypedef struct Data { int value; struct Data *next; } Data;\nData* insert(Data* head, int value){\n    Data* n = (Data*)malloc(sizeof(Data));\n    n-&gt;value = value; n-&gt;next = head;\n    return n;\n}\nData* reconnect(Data* head, int value){\n    if(head==NULL || head-&gt;value==value) return head;\n    Data *prev=NULL, *curr=head;\n    while(curr!=NULL &amp;&amp; curr-&gt;value!=value){\n        prev=curr; curr=curr-&gt;next;\n    }\n    if(curr!=NULL &amp;&amp; prev!=NULL){\n        prev-&gt;next=curr-&gt;next;\n        curr-&gt;next=head; head=curr;\n    }\n    return head;\n}\nint main(){\n    Data *head=NULL, *curr;\n    for(int i=1; i&lt;=5; i++) head=insert(head,i);\n    head=reconnect(head,3);\n    for(curr=head; curr!=NULL; curr=curr-&gt;next)\n        printf(\"%d\", curr-&gt;value);\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"35421","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","linked","연결리스트 · reconnect"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"c2b46ceede98803f9e344ca1","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-java-2","number":16,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">public static void main(String[] args) {\n    int[] data = {3, 5, 8, 12, 17};\n    System.out.println(\n        func(data, 0, data.length - 1));\n}\nstatic int func(int[] a, int st, int end) {\n    if (st &gt;= end) return 0;\n    int mid = (st + end) / 2;\n    return a[mid] + Math.max(\n        func(a, st, mid),\n        func(a, mid + 1, end));\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"20","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","recur","재귀 · 배열 분할 · Math.max"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"d5de0464743be5f45b56adc2","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-c-3","number":17,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\nvoid set(int** arr, int* data, int rows, int cols){\n    for(int i=0; i&lt;rows*cols; ++i)\n        arr[((i+1)/rows)%rows][(i+1)%cols] = data[i];\n}\nint main(){\n    int rows=3, cols=3, sum=0;\n    int data[] = {5,2,7,4,1,8,3,6,9};\n    int** arr;\n    arr = (int**)malloc(sizeof(int*)*rows);\n    for(int i=0; i&lt;cols; i++)\n        arr[i] = (int*)malloc(sizeof(int)*cols);\n    set(arr, data, rows, cols);\n    for(int i=0; i&lt;rows*cols; i++)\n        sum += arr[i/rows][i%cols] * (i%2==0 ? 1 : -1);\n    for(int i=0; i&lt;rows; i++) free(arr[i]);\n    free(arr);\n    printf(\"%d\", sum);\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"13","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","pointer","2차원 동적 배열 · malloc"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"482842065a5ff86d3c257483","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-java-3","number":18,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">class Parent {\n    static int total = 0;\n    int v = 1;\n    public Parent() {\n        total += (++v); show();\n    }\n    public void show() {\n        total += total;\n    }\n}\nclass Child extends Parent {\n    int v = 10;\n    public Child() {\n        v += 2; total += v++; show();\n    }\n    @Override\n    public void show() {\n        total += total * 2;\n    }\n}\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Child();\n        System.out.println(Parent.total);\n    }\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"54","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","inherit","상속 · 생성자 · static total"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"e45a7fd21bdb35ebadcd8592","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-c-4","number":19,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\nchar Data[5] = {'B','A','D','E'};\nchar c;\nint main(){\n    int i, temp, temp2;\n    c = 'C';\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", Data[3] - Data[1]);\n    for(i=0; i&lt;5; ++i)\n        if(Data[i] &gt; c) break;\n    temp = Data[i]; Data[i] = c; i++;\n    for(; i&lt;5; ++i){\n        temp2 = Data[i]; Data[i] = temp; temp = temp2;\n    }\n    for(i=0; i&lt;5; i++) printf(\"%c\", Data[i]);\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"4\nBACDE","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","array","배열 삽입 정렬 · 문자"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"2216c33c37f3d3e114dd40be","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2025-1-java-4","number":20,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">아래 코드의 출력값을 작성하시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">public static void main(String[] args) {\n    int a = 5, b = 0;\n    try {\n        System.out.print(a / b);\n    } catch(ArithmeticException e) {\n        System.out.print(\"출력1\");\n    } catch(ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException e) {\n        System.out.print(\"출력2\");\n    } catch(NumberFormatException e) {\n        System.out.print(\"출력3\");\n    } catch(Exception e) {\n        System.out.print(\"출력4\");\n    } finally {\n        System.out.print(\"출력5\");\n    }\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"출력1출력5","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","exception","try-catch-finally 체인"],"round_no":1,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2025년 1회","card_label":null,"year":2025,"part":null,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"}]}